<title>INDIA: TABLE-India's Jindal 1996/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India's Jindal 1996/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    557.1  vs     924.2</p>
<p>    Gross sales	10,135.5  vs  11,389.6</p>
<p>    Other income	  174.2  vs     102.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  599.6  vs     500.3</p>
<p>    Provision for tax    45.0  vs	 2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its future growth was likely to be sustained through the completion of an existing expansion cum modernisation programme involving an outlay of 4.63 billion rupees at Hissar and Raigarh.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
